{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>ViuTV綜藝節目《直樂 VIURIETY The Choose Day 2.0》昨晚（3日）播出最新一集，多對男女參賽者的感情線迎來大洗牌。眾人在爭奪合宿之旅資格的過程中，有人勇敢直球示愛，亦有人在深入交流後關係急轉直下。一向形象堅強的女參賽者在約會期間情緒失控落淚，背後隱藏着令人意想不到的轉折。Chuck咖啡廳突發表白...</p>\n<p>ViuTV綜藝節目《直樂 VIURIETY The Choose Day 2.0》昨晚（3日）播出最新一集，多對男女參賽者的感情線迎來大洗牌。眾人在爭奪合宿之旅資格的過程中，有人勇敢直球示愛，亦有人在深入交流後關係急轉直下。一向形象堅強的女參賽者在約會期間情緒失控落淚，背後隱藏着令人意想不到的轉折。</p>\n<h2>Chuck咖啡廳突發表白Muji首度大膽示愛</h2>\n<p>男參賽者在此環節需要盲選約會場地，進而引發連串變數。Chuck憑藉過往對Muji喜好的了解，成功在咖啡廳與對方見面，互動期間他主動試探女方期望。當Muji坦承希望兩人有單獨約會機會時，Chuck隨即投下震撼彈，當面直認「我希望每一次約會都係同你！」更揚言希望在旅程中尋找Soulmate，而目前正與該名靈魂伴侶共進晚餐，令女方面紅耳赤。另一邊廂，Howard即使內心想與宇夫互動，最終仍跟隨自己想法選擇最刺激越野車項目，並期盼能巧遇對方。</p>\n<h2>Kenneth與丁丁農莊體驗觸發真誠對話</h2>\n<p>截然不同的約會氛圍同時在傳統農莊部落上演，Kenneth與丁丁首次配對成功並換上傳統服飾體驗製作麻糬。兩人在過程中不斷互相鬥嘴與搞笑，氣氛起初相當融洽。然而隨着話題逐漸深入，雙方展開一場毫無保留的真誠對話，Kenneth在傾談後罕有地直接向對方表示感到後悔。這番言論瞬間擊潰丁丁心理防線，令平時展現Tough女強人姿態的她當場感動落淚，兩人關係在約會後出現巨大轉變。</p>\n<h2>邱比特獻計延續配對翊行慘遭宇夫冷待</h2>\n<p>節目由陳俞希與練美娟聯手主持，並特別邀請《全民造星4》出身女團COLLAR三位成員沈貞巧、陳泳伽與許軼擔任邱比特，為眾人出謀獻策。今季節目延續上一季成功配對者基礎，再加入全新參賽者試圖擾亂原有戀愛局面。以翊行及宇夫為例，翊行如願在農莊與心儀對象見面並瘋狂散發好感，甚至公開表示覺得雙方最為合適。可惜宇夫未有接受這份熱情，反而直接建議對方應該多認識其他參賽者，未有正面回應對方。</p>\n<h2>丁丁爆喊惹網民心痛Chuck直球告白獲讚賞</h2>\n<p>隨着各組約會情節曝光，參賽者之間錯綜複雜的互動隨即成為網上熱話。不少觀眾對於Chuck能夠把握機會大膽表白感到驚喜，紛紛留言「直球對決真係好有勇氣」、「Soulmate嗰句直接命中紅心」。同時亦有大批網民對丁丁落淚一幕大感愕然，認為女強人展現脆弱一面極具衝擊力，留言表示「見到丁丁喊覺得好心痛」、「Kenneth到底講咗咩令到佢咁激動」。網上持續湧現關於眾人合宿名單最終走向相關留言。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179376043480729973_5301817076aea9cb3610f5.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"VS--YouTube-VIURIETYTheChooseDay20-YouTube-0’02”.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179376043480729973_5301817076aea9cb3610f5.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179376043680369824_8671562566aea9cb50b358.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"VS--YouTube-VIURIETYTheChooseDay20-YouTube-0’03” (1).jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179376043680369824_8671562566aea9cb50b358.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179376043860882378_19733424446aea9cb6f1a99.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"VS--YouTube-VIURIETYTheChooseDay20-YouTube-0’08”.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179376043860882378_19733424446aea9cb6f1a99.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179376044057094497_11019833296aea9cb8f3345.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"節目參賽者 丁丁.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179376044057094497_11019833296aea9cb8f3345.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>節目參賽者 丁丁（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179376044251679799_9193298766aea9cbab5d54.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"節目參賽者 宇夫.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179376044251679799_9193298766aea9cbab5d54.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>節目參賽者 宇夫（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179376044475742229_6664433606aea9cbd112e5.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"而平時一向好Tough的女強人丁丁更感動落淚！.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179376044475742229_6664433606aea9cbd112e5.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>而平時一向好Tough的女強人丁丁更感動落淚！（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17937604464939686_682917726aea9cbed3518.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"節目參賽者 Angel.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17937604464939686_682917726aea9cbed3518.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>節目參賽者 Angel（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179376044803832163_20434975916aea9cc051c0a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"節目參賽者 Muji.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179376044803832163_20434975916aea9cc051c0a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>節目參賽者 Muji（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179376044959959423_11102069286aea9cc1dfe40.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"雖然翊行超心心眼宇夫，更表示覺得與對方最適合，但宇夫反而想叫翊行認識一下其他人。.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179376044959959423_11102069286aea9cc1dfe40.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>雖然翊行超心心眼宇夫，更表示覺得與對方最適合，但宇夫反而想叫翊行認識一下其他人。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179376045137713763_12686012966aea9cc394493.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chuck此時突然心動表白：「我希望每一次約會都係同你！」令Muji面都紅埋。.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179376045137713763_12686012966aea9cc394493.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Chuck此時突然心動表白：「我希望每一次約會都係同你！」令Muji面都紅埋。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179376045278996526_18226860416aea9cc518edd.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Kenneth與丁丁在傳統農莊部落穿着傳統服飾，體驗製作麻糬等。.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179376045278996526_18226860416aea9cc518edd.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Kenneth與丁丁在傳統農莊部落穿着傳統服飾，體驗製作麻糬等。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T03:06:25.362581+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1714,"images":11,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T02:47:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T03:58:41.301952+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T03:00:00.512564+00:00","content_hash":"0d646716c4921b1f8e86422d484dec9279e14c7b31087325e38e5ad76407b0c2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}